---
import BuySection from './BuySection.astro';
---
<div id="dim-past" class="page">
  <div class="past-hero">
    <canvas id="past-canvas"></canvas>
    <div class="past-hero-text">
      <div class="era-tag rv">3 · Past · Wardenclyffe Tower · 1893</div>
      <h1 class="past-h1 rv d1">Step into<br>Tesla's <em>laboratory</em>.<br>1893.</h1>
      <p class="past-lead rv d2">The air cracks with ozone. Bolts of man-made lightning fill the room while he sits, calm, reading — a tower that should not exist, transmitting free energy through the Earth itself.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ticker amber"><div class="ttrack"><span>⚡ WARDENCLYFFE</span><span>·</span><span>1893</span><span>·</span><span>FREE ENERGY</span><span>·</span><span>TESLA</span><span>·</span><span>3 · 6 · 9</span><span>·</span><span>⚡ WARDENCLYFFE</span><span>·</span><span>1893</span><span>·</span><span>FREE ENERGY</span><span>·</span><span>TESLA</span><span>·</span><span>3 · 6 · 9</span><span>·</span></div></div>
  <div class="past-content">
    <p class="grid-eyebrow rv">3 truths · before they cut the power</p>
    <div class="past-grid three">
      <div class="pc rv"><p class="pc-yr">3 · 1899 · Wardenclyffe</p><h3 class="pc-h">Free energy at <em>light speed</em>.</h3><p class="pc-p">No meter. No bill. No gatekeeper. Wireless energy for every human on Earth — already rising when the money ran out.</p></div>
      <div class="pc rv d1"><p class="pc-yr">6 · All History · The Pattern</p><h3 class="pc-h">Power always <em>controls</em> the energy.</h3><p class="pc-p">Pharaohs controlled the Nile. Kings controlled trade. Banks control money. The pattern repeats — until someone breaks it.</p></div>
      <div class="pc rv d2"><p class="pc-yr">9 · The Frequency · 3·6·9</p><h3 class="pc-h">The key to the <em>universe</em>.</h3><p class="pc-p">Not obsessed with numbers. Obsessed with truth. The pattern beneath all creation — the signal Wardenclyffe was built around.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="blueprint rv">
      <div class="blueprint-stamp">CONFIDENTIAL · 1903</div>
      <p class="blueprint-q">"Where do we put the <em>meter</em>?"</p>
      <p>J.P. Morgan's question when Tesla pitched free wireless energy. There was no answer. The funding was cut. The tower demolished in 1917. The monopoly survived 100 more years.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="past-tesla-q"><blockquote class="rv">"If you knew the magnificence of 3, 6 and 9, you would have a key to the universe."</blockquote><cite class="rv d1">Nikola Tesla · 1856–1943</cite></div>
    <div class="past-bridge rv"><h2>A century later,<br><em>Solana broke it</em>.</h2><p class="rv d1">65,000 transactions per second. $0.00025 per transaction. The meter J.P. Morgan demanded still doesn't exist here.</p><button class="btn-past rv d2" data-hub>↩ Back to Hub</button></div>
  </div>
  <BuySection />
</div>
